#: resource-bar@ticko4.github.io/prefs.js:167
msgid ""
"Each metric becomes an item with an icon, a gauge or graph and its value, "
"like Noctalia’s sysmon widget."
msgstr ""
"Metrika bakoitza elementu bihurtzen da, ikono batekin, neurgailu edo grafiko "
"batekin eta bere balioarekin, Noctaliaren sysmon trepetak bezala."

