msgid "Default disk"
msgstr "Disko lehenetsia"

#: resource-bar@ticko4.github.io/prefs.js:381
msgid ""
"Used by disk metrics that do not name a specific disk. The menu always lists "
"every disk."
msgstr ""
"Disko jakin bat adierazten ez duten disko-metrikek erabiltzen dute. Menuak "
"disko guztiak erakusten ditu beti."

